    "enUS": {
      "description": "Now that hit the spot!  Nothing like a piping hot - nay, SCALDING mornbrew on a cold winter's day to warm your cackles of yer soul.\n\nHere ya go {name} - be a pal and take this empty mug back to Nori for me, would ya now.",
      "summary": "Return Nori's Mug to Nori Pridedrift.",
      "title": "Bring Back the Mug",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
